menu "Smoker controller diagnostics"

config SMOKER_MAX31865_CONNECTED_DIAGNOSTIC
    bool "Run the connected MAX31865 SPI diagnostic"
    default n
    help
        Build a target-only bring-up image for the final soldered MAX31865
        SPI wiring recorded by smoker_platform.
        The diagnostic does not construct the normal application runtime or any
        heater output. Keep this disabled for ordinary production builds.

endmenu
